;; actually deployed and live on Bitcoin mainnet as
;; SP37FXV56C8S6TNYGVTB06TE9Y449638WG9VK71YB.zest-strategy-live-v2 (registered
;; on the router as the "zest" route, active as of this writing). Pulled
;; verbatim via `GET /v2/contracts/source/<address>/zest-strategy-live-v2` from
;; api.mainnet.hiro.so, byte-for-byte, not retyped or reconstructed from memory.
;;
;; DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE. Clarity contracts are immutable once deployed, so
;; editing this file can never change what's actually live — it would only
;; make this snapshot stop matching the chain, defeating its purpose. It is
;; also NOT tracked in Clarinet.toml (references live mainnet Zest principals
;; directly, so it can't typecheck as a local/simnet contract).
;;
;; This file exists because `contracts/zest-strategy-live.clar` (no "-v2"
;; suffix) has since moved on to prototype a later, undeployed
;; oracle-dynamic redesign (adds a caller-supplied <oracle-trait> argument to
