;; longer matches what's deployed. If you need to know what BitYield's live
;; Zest route actually runs today, read *this* file, not that one. To
;; re-verify at any time: `curl -s
;; https://api.mainnet.hiro.so/v2/contracts/source/SP37FXV56C8S6TNYGVTB06TE9Y449638WG9VK71YB/zest-strategy-live-v2?proof=0
